{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-08T08:20:57.470Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"5d97cc75851de74b9275ff63","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-wzmbvn","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-0jzl5t","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-wzmbvn","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:20:57.470Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 2 of PR 1687 (P2, fixed). A stored comments[2]: null,null loaded, but --if-absent then crashed. appendAnnotationEntry dereferenced entry.author in its duplicate predicate, on the CLI, MCP and SDK ifAbsent paths for all three collections. The same review surfaced a second case: an edit of a malformed entry spread a bare string into character keys (0, 1, 2 and so on).\n\nThe fix routes both through isAnnotationRecord. The duplicate check skips non-record entries. editedAnnotationEntry replaces a malformed entry with a well-formed collection entry via the collection's createEntry, so an edit repairs it. The spec covers an idempotent append twice plus a repair-by-edit for comments, notes and learnings, and the three cases fail against the previous annotations.ts.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-08T08:20:57.470Z"}],"before_hash":"947ed72cf32bdea19730e5a09da9e238a301391d11bf0b1c5360a94eafc825cf","after_hash":"ad111836db92f7b60b1f0cd81ace6348c93bebbca60f0075ee1c943aa8f6c6df","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"bcc281e655c2e18e2b1a463c3384143fff01d3fdf241cd73c8c8909ee83c23ec"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-08T08:41:12.432Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"5d97cc75851de74b9275ff63","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-wzmbvn","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-0jzl5t","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-wzmbvn","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:41:12.432Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"CodeRabbit review of PR 1687, two minor findings, both fixed.\n\n(1) Comparator cycle. compareTimestampStrings compares two parseable stamps by time and a mixed pair as text, so mixed valid and invalid created_at values could form a cycle. Example: A 2026-11-08T00:30:00+01:00 sorts before B 2026-11-07T23:45:00Z by time, B before X 2026-11-07T99 as text, and X before A as text. compareLogValues now groups by hasParseableTimestamp first (unparseable stamps sort first), then compares within each group. All six orderings of the three entries now sort the same way.\n\n(2) Blank refusal text. The guarded-edit refusal printed a blank time for created_at \"\" and the raw number for created_at 42. It now labels both as an unrecorded time, and details.actual_created_at reports a stored string or null.\n\nThe spec adds both cases, and they fail against the previous code.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-08T08:41:12.432Z"}],"before_hash":"ad111836db92f7b60b1f0cd81ace6348c93bebbca60f0075ee1c943aa8f6c6df","after_hash":"f979262ce70f025b807c622c267170a5c01d8a2219c981d91b05b3e6b7128876","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"729f2928c5b41e831834458d053993bb4127be52f56acba4b4e0c2d99116905f"}
