{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-08T09:06:59.098Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"5d97cc75851de74b9275ff63","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-wzmbvn","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-0jzl5t","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-wzmbvn","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:06:59.097Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Greptile review of PR 1687 (P1, fixed): the legacy-exact logSortFields converted every field with String() up front. A stored field holding valid JSON such as text: {\"toString\": 42} makes String() throw \"Cannot convert object to primitive value\". The legacy comparator only converted text when created_at tied, so the item used to load and now failed. logSortKeyString now falls back to the Object.prototype.toString tag when conversion throws. Where String() succeeds it is the same ToString the legacy comparator applied, so legacy equivalence holds. The pairwise spec adds that value as a text and as a created_at and asserts that no pair throws; that check fails against the previous commit.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-08T09:06:59.098Z"}],"before_hash":"8f898f1283eb43ba65d07792b6535d76c90052883154e9cf00bef6376d381649","after_hash":"93e69289bc10328b5cb2254fdfaa7238d7b32c9dba4b03bb1d4a6d0ecef20732","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"1eeac76143cf9a10a62ea19f6d8ca3b8d953d8e0ef6006bd17771b36cd416a0a"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-08T09:10:37.683Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"5d97cc75851de74b9275ff63","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-wzmbvn","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-0jzl5t","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-0jzl5t","lineage:pm-wzmbvn","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/6","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:10:37.683Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 5 of PR 1687 (P2) independently reproduced the Greptile finding at fcc3f415d. Through both the TOON and JSON Markdown parsers, an item with text: {\"toString\": null} on an entry with a distinct created_at loaded on main and threw at fcc3f415d. The same logSortKeyString fix covers it. The added full-document spec parses that item in both formats, including an author array that contains the unconvertible object, and fails against fcc3f415d. Codex also ran 2,000 random sorts (1,898,201 comparator calls) over coercible values; all of them matched the legacy order, and it found no other defect in the SDK/search handling, the release wiring or the docs.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-08T09:10:37.683Z"}],"before_hash":"93e69289bc10328b5cb2254fdfaa7238d7b32c9dba4b03bb1d4a6d0ecef20732","after_hash":"60f6b74dbfe49e337a2538580f3b52a3e87008f877f0524b3ff6e690e45e79a8","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"253a3e59bde9fb48f6c142f453f6e2033e6cd92fdf028b3e78309911996dfba8"}
